<header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">Legacy to Live By · Testnet demo, no real accounts</p><h1>Human Gold Rush</h1><p class="intro">Explore how community force is built without money. Churches, merchants, community centers, and neighbors gather through LAUGH (Leaders Annual United Group Hug) events to practice trust, recognize gratitude, and fulfill future plans.</p><blockquote>What becomes possible when a community treats presence and follow-through as its first resources?</blockquote><div class="actions"><a href="prepare-laugh-event.html" class="cta-mega">Participate as a MEGAvoter<span>→</span></a><a href="discord-gracebook.html" class="cta-yam">Observe as a YAM’er<span>→</span></a><a href="three-ways-to-respond.html" class="cta-walk">Walk Away, No Pressure<span>→</span></a></div><div class="pentagon"><p class="section-label">Choose a Peace Pentagon branch to support</p><div class="pentagon-branches" role="group" aria-label="Peace Pentagon branch"><button type="button" data-branch="planning">Planning</button><button type="button" data-branch="budget">Budget</button><button type="button" data-branch="media">Media</button><button type="button" data-branch="distribution">Distribution</button><button type="button" data-branch="membership">Membership</button></div><small>Observers (YAM’ers) watch, monitor, and respond within their chosen branch. MEGAvoters may lead within any branch.</small></div><form class="rsvp-email" action="#" method="post"><label for="rsvp-email">RSVP with your email — how will you show up?</label><div class="rsvp-row"><input id="rsvp-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required><input type="hidden" name="pentagon_branch" id="pentagon-branch-value"><button type="submit">Count Me In<span>→</span></button></div><small>Connects to the WordPress mailing list on publish.</small></form><aside class="notice"><strong>Pilot status</strong><p>Human Gold Rush is currently a single production site — the UNG (DAH) center in Dahlonega, Georgia — producing the Tiger's Eye touchstone. Expansion to 100 additional DAH-model production licenses is projected for August 11, 2027. Until then, this remains a single-site pilot.</p></aside></header><section class="content-grid"><article><span>01</span><div><h2>Start with a touchstone</h2><p>The Tiger’s Eye Covenant is a physical reminder to practice FAITH: Fair, Accepting, Insightful, Transparent, and Humble. It is an invitation, never a condition of human worth.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2>Three voluntary responses</h2><p>Participate, observe, or walk away. Every response matters. A walk-away is behavioral gold because it may reveal missing trust, unclear purpose, poor timing, or an unseen barrier.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2>One twelve-week window</h2><p>Each quarter is a continuous twelve-week observation and maturity window. Activity accumulates throughout the whole period; it is not divided into prescribed participant phases.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h2>Trade value without money</h2><p>Seeking Gratitude recognizes presence, contribution, and fulfillment. It may carry trade value, but gratitude is never accepted as payment, currency, credit, or a financial claim.</p></div></article><article><span>05</span><div><h2>A pet rock, Pokémon-GO style</h2><p>Human Gold Rush borrows two familiar ideas — a pet rock’s meaning-from-nothing charm and a location-based scavenger hunt — to study whether people show up. Three QR codes (Identity, Trade, Gratitude) and a registered smartphone replace the app store purchase with a real handshake.</p></div></article></section>